{{PageBanner|Ranma banner en 2022.png|custom|width=700|height=366}}
A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the popular anime known as '''Ranma 1/2''' (らんま1/2, ''Ranma 1/2'', '''Ranma 1/2''') was originally held from April 12th, 2021 to April 26th, 2021. The collaboration includes [[Ranma 1/2 Collaboration Event/Gacha Drop|exclusive Gacha]], stages, [[Catnip Challenges]] and stamps going on during collaboration the period.<br>
The anime is published by Rumiko Takahashi.

==Event Information==
{{Color|#FF0000|'''"Ranma 1/2"'''}} enters the Battle Cats dojo for a limited time crossover event!<br>
{{Color|#E500FF|'''From October 10th (11am) to October 24th, 2022 (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●"Ranma 1/2" Collab Capsules!'''}}<br>
Collect special Battle Cats versions of the "Ranma 1/2" heroes like {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Ranma Saotome'''}} and {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Akane Tendo'''}} in this special crossover Rare Capsule set! Also, the new Super Rare character Genma Saotome (Panda) joins the fray!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''You might collect...'''}}<br>
[[Ranma Saotome (M) (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Ranma Saotome  (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Heir to the Saotome style of Anything Goes Martial Arts. Delivers Massive Omnistrike damage to Red & Floating!<br>
[[Akane Tendo (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#0000FF|'''Akane Tendo  (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong-willed and pure-hearted girl engaged to Ranma. Strikes with Long-range Savage Blows that have Barrier Breaking power!<br>
[[Ryoga Hibiki (Pig) (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FFCC00|'''Ryoga Hibiki (Pig)  (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
A cute piglet pampered<br>
by Akane. But when he's doused in hot water... Tough against Metal/Black enemies, with a chance to Knockback!<br>
[[Shampoo (Cat) (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#CC99FF|'''Shampoo (Cat)  (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
When doused in water, Cursed Springs magic turns this lithe fighter into a cat.
Has a chance to fire a Mini-Wave when she attacks!<br>
[[Mousse (Duck) (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#99CC00|'''Mousse (Duck)  (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
When doused in water, Cursed Springs magic turns this clever warrior into a duck. Long-range strikes might Curse Aliens/Zombies.<br>
[[Ranma Saotome (Leotard) (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Ranma Saotome (Leotard)  (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Wears a leotard and uses her skillful fingers to try her hand at gynmastics. Can temprarily Freeze Angels and Black enemies with long-range area attacks.<br>
[[Happosai (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#800080|'''Happosai  (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks might Knockback Red, Floating and Zombies.<br>
[[Ukyo Kuonji (GR) (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF9900|'''Ukyo Kuonji (GR)  (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks have a chance to Weaken Metal and might Critical.<br>
[[Tatewaki Kuno (Gi) (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008080|'''Tatewaki Kuno  (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks might Slow/Knockback Angels, plus a chance to Dodge !<br>
[[Genma Saotome (Panda) (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#00CCFF|'''Genma Saotome (Panda)  (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Deals Massive Damage to Traitless and Aku enemies!<br>
[[Akane Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#3366FF|'''Akane Cat  (Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Attacks have a chance to strike a Savage Blow!

<nowiki>*</nowiki>During the crossover campaign period, you will have a set chance to collect one of the "Ranma 1/2" collab units from the "Ranma 1/2" capsule set. Standard units may also appear from this capsule set.<br>
<nowiki>**</nowiki>"Ranma 1/2" units cannot be collected from other Rare Capsule sets. Please make sure that you have selected the "Ranma 1/2" capsule set by tapping the icon at the top of the Rare Capsule Machine page.<br>
<nowiki>***</nowiki>If "Ranma 1/2" Collab Capsules fail to appear in the Rare Capsule Machine, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Collab Stages in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
Ranma and Co. deliver their letter of challenge! Fight against heroes from the hit comic in these fun-filled collab stages!<br>
Also, some of the stages have had their rewards refreshed!

{{Color|#00FFFF|'''・Collab Map: "Rumble in the Tendo Dojo"'''}}<br>
Visit the Legend Stages/Event Stages to take on limited map {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Rumble in the Tendo Dojo'''}}!<br>
Clearing any stage will give you a small chance to earn the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''limited collab hero "}}[[Ranma Cat (M) (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Ranma Cat (M)"'''}}]] as a reward! Later, more difficult stages offer higher drop rates for this hero!<br>
You can earn 30 Cat Food even if you have cleared the stages as the rewards record has been completely reset.

<nowiki>*</nowiki>If you have already earned Ranma Cat (M) previously, you will not be able to obtain it again.<br>
<nowiki>**</nowiki>The use of treasure radar guarantees you to obtain a Ranma Cat (M) after clearing a stage<br>
<nowiki>***</nowiki>Activate Ranma Cat (M) by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.

{{Color|#00CCFF|'''・Collab Map: "The Cursed Springs"}}<br>
Travel to the source of the weird magics affecting Ranma and friends when you enter "The Cursed Springs" challenge map! Reap {{Color|#FF00FF|'''huge XP rewards'''}} by clearing these stages!<br>
Plus, earn higher timed scores to get rewarded with even more items for your victory!

<nowiki>*</nowiki>You can check the rewards available by tapping the Timed Score button on the Stage Select screen.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Defeat a horde of martial artists in a collab-only challenge stage!'''}}<br>
Visit the Event/Legend Stages to challenge the all-new gauntlet map {{Color|#00CCFF|Test of Might; "Ranma 1/2"}}!<br>
Can you defeat stage after stage of tough and tricky "Ranma 1/2" heroes and reach Level 30? Each challenge cleared will unlock the next, tougher stage with even more awesome rewards!

<nowiki>*</nowiki>Once you have exhausted all attempts, you will have to wait for them to replenish before trying again.<br>
<nowiki>**</nowiki>Catamin A can be used to challenge a stage again immediately.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Special collab missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Take on Special Mission challenges and earn delightful bonus rewards by playing limited-time-only "Ranma 1/2" events!

<nowiki>*</nowiki>"Ranma 1/2" Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until October 24th, 2022 at 10:59 am. You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Cat Food Rewards Everyday!'''}}<br>
During this collab event, every day you visit the Cat Base you will be rewarded with a {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Rare Ticket'''}} and other useful in-game items as a present!<br>
Play every day and don't miss out on these free gifts!

<nowiki>*</nowiki>14 daily bonuses are available.

©Rumiko Takahashi/Shogakukan

